le we go over why you should create varied and strong usernames.`,image:ve,link:(0,sh.qm)(\"/safe-username\")},{title:()=>(0,tv.c)(\"Blog\").t`Take advantage of advanced email alias feature in ${eA.o8M}`,description:()=>(0,tv.c)(\"Blog\").t`Navigating an internet full of data brokers, spam, scams, and malware feels increasingly difficult. That’s why ${eA.o8M} goes beyond helping you manage, store, and autofill your passwords. We give you the tools to take control of your privacy and protect your inboxes with hide-my-email aliases.`,image:g9,link:(0,sh.qm)(\"/benefits-of-email-aliases\")},{title:()=>(0,tv.c)(\"Blog\").t`How to prevent data breaches in your business`,description:()=>(0,tv.c)(\"Blog\").t`Data breaches are on the rise. For businesses, a single breach can result in stolen customer data, regulatory penalties, lost revenue, and lasting reputational damage. Luckily, your team can prevent most breaches with the right mix of security practices, technology, and awareness.`,image:g8,link:(0,sh.qm)(\"/data-breach-prevention-for-businesses\")},{title:()=>(0,tv.c)(\"Blog\").t`What are passkeys and how do they work?`,description:()=>(0,tv.c)(\"Blog\").t`Understand passkeys, their benefits over passwords, and how ${eA.o8M} keeps them safe.`,image:g7,link:(0,sh.qm)(\"/what-is-a-passkey\")}],va=()=>(0,es.jsx)(f7,{posts:vs,title:(0,tv.c)(\"Title\").t`Deep dive into password manager blog posts`}),vr=s.p+\"assets/static/download-preview-android.a4fa5c638ce627f40cdd.png\",vl=s.p+\"assets/static/download-preview-brave.c74d4685946d440bab08.png\",vn=s.p+\"assets/static/download-preview-chrome.70917e72d9fbadee1413.png\",vi=s.p+\"assets/static/download-preview-edge.dbc2221357f6a73e6b9a.png\",vo=s.p+\"assets/static/download-preview-firefox.6d06ed1f05555fa859f8.png\",vc=s.p+\"assets/static/download-preview-ios.012359c45994838a0615.png\",vd=s.p+\"assets/static/download-preview-linux.53ccdd8d3fdd8baa6da9.png\",vu=s.p+\"assets/static/download-preview-macos.80b505075a3c72ed5cb1.png\